  "interpretation": "<p data-start=\"54\" data-end=\"319\"><strong data-start=\"54\" data-end=\"67\">Piroxicam</strong> is a <strong data-start=\"73\" data-end=\"120\">nonsteroidal anti-inflammatory drug (NSAID)</strong> used to treat pain and inflammation in conditions like arthritis. An <strong data-start=\"190\" data-end=\"220\">allergy test for piroxicam</strong> helps determine whether a person has a <strong data-start=\"260\" data-end=\"280\">hypersensitivity</strong> or <strong data-start=\"284\" data-end=\"305\">allergic reaction</strong> to this drug.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1400\"><strong data-start=\"1356\" data-end=\"1400\">Possible Allergic Reactions to Piroxicam</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1402\" data-end=\"1642\">\n<li data-start=\"1402\" data-end=\"1503\">\n<p data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1443\"><strong data-start=\"1404\" data-end=\"1443\">Immediate reactions (IgE-mediated):</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1446\" data-end=\"1503\">\n<li data-start=\"1446\" data-end=\"1465\">\n<p data-start=\"1448\" data-end=\"1465\">Urticaria (hives)</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1468\" data-end=\"1480\">\n<p data-start=\"1470\" data-end=\"1480\">Angioedema</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1483\" data-end=\"1503\">\n<p data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1503\">Anaphylaxis (rare)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1505\" data-end=\"1642\">\n<p data-start=\"1507\" data-end=\"1547\"><strong data-start=\"1507\" data-end=\"1547\">Delayed reactions (T-cell mediated):</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1642\">\n<li data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1570\">\n<p data-start=\"1552\" data-end=\"1570\">Maculopapular rash</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1573\" data-end=\"1594\">\n<p data-start=\"1575\" data-end=\"1594\">Fixed drug eruption</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1597\" data-end=\"1642\">\n<p data-start=\"1599\" data-end=\"1642\">Stevens-Johnson syndrome (rare but serious)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>Test Result</strong></th>\n<th><strong>Interpretation</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Positive (Reactive)</strong></td>\n<td>Indicates <strong>allergic sensitization</strong> to piroxicam. Re-exposure may lead to allergic reactions; drug should be <strong>avoided</strong>.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Negative (Non-Reactive)</strong></td>\n<td>Suggests <strong>no current sensitization</strong> to piroxicam. However, clinical correlation is essential, especially if there is a <strong>history of past reaction</strong>.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Equivocal or Borderline</strong></td>\n<td>Results are unclear. May require <strong>repeat testing</strong> or <strong>alternative methods</strong> to confirm allergy.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3 data-start=\"326\" data-end=\"353\">&nbsp;</h3>",
